  <entry>
    <id>https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/160.0/releasenotes/</id>
    <title type="html">Thunderbird 160.0</title>
    <author>
      <name>Thunderbird</name>
      <uri>https://www.thunderbird.net</uri>
    </author>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.thunderbird.net/en-US/thunderbird/160.0/releasenotes/"/>
    <updated>2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <published>2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00</published>

    <content type="html"><![CDATA[
      

  
  

  
    

    
      
        
        

        
          <h3>What’s New</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Ctrl+A selects all filters in the Message Filters dialog</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        
          </ul>
        

        
          <h3>Changed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>OAuth sign-in windows now explain when blocked cookies may prevent sign-in</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Office 365 account setup no longer automatically offers EWS configuration</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        
          </ul>
        

        
          <h3>Fixed</h3>
        

        
        
          <ul>
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>The macOS Dock badge could omit unread counts with multiple accounts</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Opening a window could cause Thunderbird to crash</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Undo remained disabled after deleting messages, preventing their restoration</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>POP3 and news messages with LF line endings could be parsed incorrectly</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>The option to create a mailing list was missing from File &gt; New</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Restoring toolbar defaults unexpectedly closed the customization dialog</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Thunderbird did not warn before repairing folders with offline message storage</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Dragging multiple selected folders moved only one folder</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Renaming or moving folders could remove them from saved searches</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Replies to saved messages could be blocked despite a valid Reply-To address</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>The spelling dictionary menu was empty in the Subject field</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Tabbing from Subject field focused the header divider instead of message body</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Edit as New Message did not work for some news messages</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Address book setup returned to mail setup when no mail account existed</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Exchange autodiscovery failed when redirected to another email address</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Empty message filter conditions could cause incorrect matches</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Address book filter conditions failed to match messages with missing addresses</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Address book website fields incorrectly prefixed non-HTTP links with HTTPS</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Some CardDAV contacts with multiline street addresses appeared empty</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CardDAV contacts were saved in a format unsupported by some servers</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Photos saved in vCard 3.0 contacts could fail to appear in other clients</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Windows system tray icon failed to update when new mail arrived</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Processing some sender addresses could freeze new mail notifications</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>IMAP retention settings could delete newer messages instead of older ones</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Message database updates could cause Thunderbird to crash</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>IMAP namespace root folders could be missing or have incorrect permissions</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Graph account setup failed for tenants without a SharePoint license</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Various News Reader improvements</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>IMAP folders could disappear after restart on servers using compression</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Various Feed Reader improvements</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Delete Event remained enabled for read-only calendars in the Today Pane</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Attendance options were missing for some recurring event series</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>The task list stopped updating after toolbar customization</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>CalDAV reminders could not be dismissed or snoozed</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Some webcal calendar subscriptions were incorrectly blocked</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Invalid ICS calendar files could be overwritten when events were changed</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p>Visual and UX improvements</p>
          
        </li>
      
    
      
        
        

        

        
        

        
        

        <li>
          <p><a href="https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/security/known-vulnerabilities/thunderbird/#thunderbird160">Security fixes</a></p>
          
        </li>
      
    
    </ul>
  
  

<p>As always, you’re encouraged to <a href="https://connect.mozilla.org/t5/ideas/idb-p/ideas/label-name/thunderbird">tell us what you think</a>, <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/questions/new/thunderbird">ask for help</a>, or <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=Thunderbird">file a bug in Bugzilla</a></p>
<style> li p { display: inline; } </style>
      ]]>
    </content>
  </entry>
  
